        Surfaces, agents and an authorization model you did not hand-write
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-pretty text-muted">
        Everything here is derived from the same resource declarations that produced the schema. That is not primarily a saving — it is a guarantee, because a surface derived from the resource cannot show a field the policy hides.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  {/* ==================== 7 · Surfaces ==================== */}
  <Section
